        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Solid Brass Extended Lip Door Strikes</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese door latch and deadbolt strike plates are available in 4 lengths and 16 great finishes. They are all Solid Brass. Packaged with 12 combination wood/machine screws finished to match for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese are especially handy for custom installations, and extra thick  doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>To calculate lip to center length use the following formula and round to closest size:\r\n<b>Take door thickness, divide by 2 and add .375</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 4 <b>Lip to Center Lengths:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BAL-6039.xxx.X158</b>\r\n<li>Lip to Center Length: 1.625\"(1-5/8\") </li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4.875\" (4-7/8\")</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 1.25\" (1-1/4\")</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BAL-6039.xxx.X178</b>\r\n<li>Lip to Center Length: 1.875\" (1-7/8\") </li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4.875\" (4-7/8\")</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 1.25\" (1-1/4\")</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BAL-6039.xxx.X214</b>\r\n<li>Lip to Center Length: 2.25\" (2-1/4\") </li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4.875\" (4-7/8\")</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 1.25\" (1-1/4\")</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BAL-6039.xxx.X300</b>\r\n<li>Lip to Center Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4.875\" (4-7/8\")</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 1.25\" (1-1/4\")</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>These strike plates are handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>",
